 "_note": "Snapshot of the Okara Design System Variables (Figma file 7glNMA9d7iVJFf2CvyrzAb), read Sept 25, 2026 (Typography collection added the same day: DM Sans + Martian Mono). Values are hex or numbers; {\"alias\": name} points at a variable in Primitives. To update: re-read Figma, write this file, run `node scripts/sync-tokens.mjs` (rewrites the token block in src/ui/okara.css), then `npm test`. Sept 25: every SemiBold text style set to Medium (500) except Display/Title (page titles), which stays SemiBold. Sept 26: + neutral/stone-50, border/secondary (Divider, dropdown list, notification panel, user card), border/tertiary (divider in the Entries tooltip). Later Sept 26: + neutral/stone-500; text/muted and action/disable now stone-500; + border/selected-item (brand/indigo-light: the border of a filled Input or Dropdown). Sept 28: + space/nav-padding-y 6, space/control-gap 10, space/tags-indent 56, radius/card 20, data/green-light, neutral/surface-transparent, neutral/off-white-transparent, surface/primary-transparent, surface/body-transparent (native-app cleanup). Later Sept 28: text styles re-read (Headings 600 and tracking 0, Heading/Large 20/24, Value/Large 16). Sept 29: Spacing and Radius moved into a new Surface collection with two modes, Mobile and Desktop (Desktop smaller); text styles now bind their size and line height to Surface size/* and lh/* variables. Surface entries are {Mobile, Desktop}; text styles carry sizeVar/lhVar (lhVar null = auto) and the Mobile values.",
